Description: Field Extension for OpenMANET
 Status web page and API on port 8787, PiSugar battery, status light driver and
 phone internet helper. After install it runs a self-test; results are kept in
 /tmp/field-extensions-selftest.txt and /opt/field-extensions/selftest.sh runs it again.
